# Private dev-access secrets. These patterns existed ONLY in the copy of
# .gitignore on xeno-platform-001 and were never committed — found 2026-07-30
# while reconciling that box against main. Catching the box up with
# `git reset --hard origin/main` would have deleted them, making an htpasswd
# file, a private nginx config and a secrets directory git-visible on the
# machine where they actually exist. Committing them first makes that reset safe.
*.htpasswd
nginx-private.conf
.bunker-secrets/
secrets/

# Deploy archives — `git archive HEAD` output from scripts/deploy-platform.mjs and
# hand-rolled equivalents. Large, regenerated every deploy, and never source.
# Ignored because `git add -A` has swept foreign files into a commit twice here.
deploy*.tar
